{"parse": {"title": "银光子弹", "pageid": 2277, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"银光子弹\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/18/Item-110404.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"银光子弹\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>银光子弹</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#110404</div></div><hr /><div>雕刻着花纹的银子弹，其中威力不可小觑。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">虽然这需要花费一些心思，但它绝对值得。无论你想杀的是吸血鬼还是狼人，它都帮得上忙。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">荒原合成</td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">迷途鉴定</td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-stage\">5TH-19</td><td class=\"source-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/5TH-19\" title=\"5TH-19\">逆行的舟</a><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #8c4646; padding: 0 5px;\">厄险</span><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">极小概率\n</span></td></tr></tbody></table><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weigh